<title>USA: Atmos Energy Corp Q2 net declined.</title>
<headline>Atmos Energy Corp Q2 net declined.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					  March 31	    March 31</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p>(000's except per share)</p>
<p> Operating revenues	 $199,847 $191,104 $357,500 $321,572</p>
<p> Purchased gas cost	  132,485  125,710  238,462  205,453</p>
<p> Gross profit		   67,362   65,394  119,038  116,119</p>
<p>Operating and maintenance expenses</p>
<p>				    27,733   22,013   50,058   44,809</p>
<p>Depreciation and amortization</p>
<p>				     6,161    5,335   12,386   10,926</p>
<p> Taxes, other than income    6,348    5,506   11,230    9,704</p>
<p> Income taxes		    8,533   10,368   13,758   15,563</p>
<p> Total operating expenses   48,775   43,222   87,432   81,002</p>
<p> Operating income	     18,587   22,172   31,606   35,117</p>
<p> Net income		     14,511   18,383   23,403   27,616</p>
<p> Net income per share	   0.90     1.15     1.45     1.75</p>
<p> Average shares		 16,140   15,927   16,097   15,800</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 net includes $4.4 million pretax charge for payments made to satisfy contractual benefits for two former executives equal to $2.8 million, or $0.17/shr after taxes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
